(
    title: "2010: The Graphic Adventure Game",
    description: Some("The derelict Discovery is spiralling down toward Io, and you must get it spaceworthy before it crashes. Guide a power spark through each system\'s circuit path, touching every interface exactly once while dodging flickering magnetic fields that burn components out. Send the repair drone WALDO to replace burned-out parts, bring the HAL 9000 back to help, then fire the engines to escape orbit."),
